                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your trailer is down, everything stops. Loads get delayed, schedules tighten, and margins take a hit. That's why having a trusted local partner for trailer parts in Tampa isn't a convenience; it's a necessity. At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, the goal is simple: make it easier for owner-operators and fleet managers to keep moving. With a dependable parts inventory, experienced technicians, and a team that understands how much your time matters, Sun State Trailers provides an all-in-one solution designed for real-world trucking operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-local-matters",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Local Access to Trailer Parts in Tampa Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "local-matters"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-matters-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Searching online for replacement components might seem quick, but delays in shipping or incorrect parts can cost far more than expected. Working with a local Tampa provider ensures faster turnaround, fewer mistakes, and real accountability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-matters-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing a local source for trailer parts means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-local-matters-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "dot",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Shorter downtime when repairs are needed"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Access to knowledgeable staff who understand regional conditions"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Easier follow-up if service or adjustments are required"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-matters-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Unplanned downtime can cost transportation businesses thousands of dollars per day when lost productivity and delayed shipments are factored in. That's why proximity and reliability matter just as much as price.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
